<%# ═══════════════════════════════════ FAQ ═══════════════════════════════════ %>
<section class="landing-section landing-faq">
  <div class="landing-inner" style="max-width: 720px;">
    <div class="landing-section-header">
      <span class="landing-label">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Common questions.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-faq-list">
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>How is Sabha different from Discord?</summary>
        <p>It's chat-first. Rooms, threads, search — that's the product. No Nitro, no boosts, no marketplace of bots and emoji upsells getting in the way of the conversation. And if you don't like how we run it, take the code and host it yourself. Try that with Discord.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>Is Sabha really free?</summary>
        <p>Yep. Create a workspace on sabha.co — unlimited members, unlimited history, no credit card. Every workspace gets its own SQLite database, so running one costs us almost nothing and we can keep the free tier generous. (<a href="https://cloud.sabha.co" target="_blank" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;">Sabha Cloud</a> is the paid tier where we run a dedicated server for you.)</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>Can I self-host Sabha?</summary>
        <p>Yep. Sabha runs on Rails, Hotwire, and SQLite — one server, no external dependencies. Drop it on a $10 VPS with Docker or bare metal. No managed Postgres, no Redis cluster, no Kubernetes. Your server, your data, your bytes.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>Is there a mobile app?</summary>
        <p>Not in the App Store — and you don't need one. Sabha is a PWA. Open it on iPhone or Android, hit "Add to Home Screen", and you get an app icon, push notifications, and badge counts. Same URL, same app, every device.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>How do I add AI bots to my community?</summary>
        <p>Every workspace ships with a full bot API — real-time events over WebSocket or webhooks, reading messages, posting replies, reacting, searching. Drop in the <a href="https://openclaw.org" target="_blank" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;">OpenClaw</a> plugin and you've got an LLM agent in any room with a single invite URL. Or write your own. Bots are a feature, not a marketplace.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>What's the difference between sabha.co and Sabha Cloud?</summary>
        <p>sabha.co is shared multi-tenant — free, instant, your workspace sits next door to thousands of others. <a href="https://cloud.sabha.co" target="_blank" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;">Sabha Cloud</a> is your own dedicated server with continuous backups, custom domain support, and no storage limits. Same app, different walls.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="landing-faq-item">
        <summary>Can I use a custom domain on sabha.co?</summary>
        <p>Nope. sabha.co workspaces live at <code>sabha.co/workspace_id</code> on shared infrastructure. If you want <code>chat.yourdomain.com</code>, <a href="https://cloud.sabha.co" target="_blank" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px;">Sabha Cloud</a> adds custom domain support — or you can self-host and run whatever DNS and TLS setup you want.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="landing-divider"></div>

